; engine-strict is intentionally OFF (not true) — see design/ACTIONS.md P1
; "Dev-toolchain drift past Node 14". The app RUNTIME is Node 14.15-clean and the
; full test suite passes on 14.15; the only engine mismatches are ~47 dev/build
; tools (eslint family, cssnano/postcss CSS-minify chain, concurrently, cross-env,
; svgo, ...) that floated to versions wanting Node 16-22. Hard-failing the install
; on those build-time tools blocks all work, so we warn instead of fail while the
; team reconciles the dev toolchain. Node 14.15 and all runtime deps stay locked.
; DO NOT flip back to true until the dev-toolchain reconcile task is done.
engine-strict=false
